WEBVTT

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:41.680
So, you want to tell us where we're going yet?

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:46.210
To the great goldenrain tree of the Underworld.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:50.810
So our mission is to reach this goldenrain tree?

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:52.880
Yeah.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:55.130
What will we find at this tree?

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:02.960
According to the Master, death does not exist
for the Underworld-dwelling Specters.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:04.390
What?

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.640
Death doesn't exist?

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.720
So they don't die?

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:09.830
Yeah.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:12.750
Then even that Mandrake we just killed...

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:14.900
Will eventually come back to life.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:18.860
Then we'll never beat the Specters!

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:23.570
No, the goldenrain tree holds
the key to fighting those

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:26.270
who keep returning to life, says the Master.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.300
Really?

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:29.870
Currently, we must be

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.740
in the Specter army's passage that leads
from the path to the netherworld

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:34.660
into the Underworld.

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:38.380
If we follow it, we'll reach our destination quickly.

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:40.680
Let's hurry!

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:46.010
<i>Wait for us, Sasha!</i>

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:52.910
Is this an exit?

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.660
What? What is this?

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.550
It's the Underworld's watchdog, Cerberus!

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:14.130
Beware!

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.420
It's guarding against trespassers.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.840
Look out for its three heads!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:31.600
Yato!

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.600
I can't leave this to you,

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.590
when neither of you even wear a Cloth.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:38.610
I'll take care of this little puppy.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.330
<i>Unicorn Gallop!</i>

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:53.930
Crap! Three heads isn't fair...

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:57.020
If we could only get at all
three heads simultaneously.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.130
Crap! Tenma!

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.170
All right, help me out!

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:05.050
Yeah!

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.560
I'll hit all three of them. And blow them away.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.810
<i>Pegasus Meteor Fist!</i>

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:20.230
All right!

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:25.490
Wh-Where are we?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.280
This must be the Seventh Prison,

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:32.500
where those who engaged in corruption,
thievery, or fraud in life fall.

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:35.000
So that pathway

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.700
comes all the way out here.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:41.560
Ugh. This sure is an awful place.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.260
<i>So this is the Underworld.</i>

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:54.180
<i>He used to love light and color,
and now he's in this world.</i>

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.270
<i>Alone.</i>

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:03.400
He... He's here!

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:07.030
Your friend, stupid!

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:21.000
I came to see you, Tenma.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.380
Alone...

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:29.890
<i>His blond hair has turned jet black.</i>

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:31.900
<i>But why?</i>

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:36.390
<i>Why have you, King of the Underworld, come here?</i>

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:40.410
<i>Who would have expected the
King of the Underworld to get so close?</i>

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.650
<i>What an opportunity. I won't let him get away!</i>

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.440
Prepare yourself, Hades!

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.320
What?

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:52.510
You fool.  Putting yourself between
the Pegasus Saint and me...

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.510
You should know your place!

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:57.250
Yuzuriha!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.250
Yato! Yuzuriha!

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.520
Alone, you...

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:09.770
Ah, I like it when you move, after all, Tenma.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:10.970
Huh?

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.010
You took the attack from me,
King of the Underworld,

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:16.360
and barely managed to survive.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.020
You may have been saved by Sasha's bracelet,

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:24.650
but I'm sure the fact that you're here
is more than just coincidence.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.970
So, Tenma.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:29.970
Will you, along with the Specters,

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.410
change the world with me?

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.710
Together...

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.830
Let's change the world above ground
to the tranquil calm of the dead.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:43.840
And let us cover this world in darkness.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.340
Tenma! Don't listen to him!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:51.510
We shall defeat Athena and
achieve true happiness.

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:57.100
Hell, no!

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:00.770
To join you, as you turn the world into this?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.330
You must be joking!

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.980
I'm better off with Sasha.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:08.990
I'm one of Athena's Saints now, Alone.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:14.120
I'll stick with Sasha, to protect
the world you loved.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:17.260
Alone, for your sake, too!

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:21.370
You're right, Tenma. That's how it should be.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.280
You represent what I could be.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:29.010
How will our fight end?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:32.510
When next we meet, I'll fight you.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:36.370
And I promise to smack you across the face!

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:39.150
That's my second promise, Alone!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:43.290
You always keep your promises.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:46.980
I look forward to seeing you again, Tenma.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.660
Let us meet at the Sanctuary, Tenma.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:55.120
It will be a reunion for all three of us,
our first in a long time.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:02.790
Yeah. Look forward to it.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:11.420
And I was just about to end this Holy War—

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.220
Ouch!

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:16.080
I was just trying to lighten things up!

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:19.220
Don't bother, idiot!
Come on, let's go.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.540
What?

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.820
Wow... This is...

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:33.880
The Great Falls of Blood.

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:37.140
Standing between the Sixth Prison,

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:39.900
Third Valley, and the First Trench, Cave,

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.700
is the Great Falls of Blood.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.210
And at its summit,

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:48.800
one of the great trees from the days
of myth grows, nourished by blood,

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:50.710
the Underworld's goldenrain tree.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.420
Right... Let's go!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.100
<i>Huh?</i>

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:05.100
<i>This waterfall feels strange.</i>

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.100
<i>What is this?</i>

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:11.610
Yato, Yuzuriha, something's weird.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:14.780
Huh?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.940
<i>They've stopped?</i>

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:21.620
<i>It's as if time stopped for them.</i>

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:27.620
Oh, I thought a dead man or
a Specter had wandered in.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.130
What?

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.130
I am Virgo Asmita.

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:45.640
Pegasus Saint, will you stand again before the King?

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.130
<i>No! Why...</i>

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:52.400
<i>Why is a Gold Saint in the Underworld?</i>

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:56.150
I need you to pass through the palace of Taurus,

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.420
Aldebaran.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.660
Hey, Dohko.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.540
Are you going back to the house of Libra now?

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:07.680
Did you hear the message from Jamir,
that the Specters are immortal?

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:11.170
Albafica may have turned back the Specter army,

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.100
but we can't let down our guard.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.540
But it is not all bad news.

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:21.870
Your pupil, the Pegasus Saint,
still lives and did not die.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:26.090
Yeah, but he's still stuck in the Underworld.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:29.150
I can't relax until he's back
above ground, safe and sound.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:35.220
Right now, I don't care if it's a Bronze Saint.
I just want any strong Saint...

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:39.540
The enemy might not be Specters alone.

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:41.950
What do you mean?

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:44.620
I'm talking about Virgo Asmita.

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:49.740
Dohko, as long as we are Saints of Athena,

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:51.820
we have but one path before us.

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:55.960
But he makes absolutely no effort
to leave the house of Virgo.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.510
He is unfamiliar with the advancing Specter army.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:02.580
In this Sanctuary that Athena protects,

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:08.480
he makes no effort to change
the other country's religion.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.520
I just don't like the guy.

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:15.640
And it's true, strange rumors do
follow wherever he goes.

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:18.870
And he comes and goes freely everywhere,

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:21.280
even speaking with gods.

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:25.160
Should he defect to the enemy,
he'd be a formidable opponent.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.410
I don't want to think about it.

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:32.460
<i>It's true, he is different from us in some way.</i>

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:37.630
<i>That guy... What does he meditate on
in the house of Virgo?</i>

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.690
<i>Will he really participate in this Holy War?</i>

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:43.930
<i>Who is he?</i>

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.150
<i>Is he the one?</i>

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:00.550
<i>Yato and Yuzuriha's movements have stopped.</i>

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:04.960
<i>But why does this Gold Saint,
supposedly on our side,</i>

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:07.410
<i>have what feels like an enemy Cosmo?</i>

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:11.410
You've been called the
great sinner of the heavens.

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:15.560
But when I see you before me,
you're just a little boy.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:17.430
Such a letdown.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.530
What a fool Athena is.

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:23.430
Have her eyes been clouded by the long Holy War?

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:28.200
To the young Athena,
there is no reason for this Holy War.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.180
The truth I seek may lie with the King of the Underworld.

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:36.150
You! You're a Gold Saint!
How can you betray Athena?

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:37.690
What will you do about it?

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.520
I'll fight you, of course!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.900
<i>Pegasus Meteor Fist!</i>

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.780
<i>Kaan!</i>

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:48.950
What? My Meteor Fist won't work?

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:53.040
Did you really think a weak,

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.900
emotional fist like that would work on me?

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.210
Die again, and become dust in the wind.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:05.590
How sad...

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.550
Crap.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:13.630
You're a god-killer, after all.

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:15.100
I suppose it'll take more to kill you.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.770
What?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:20.350
What are you talking about?

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:23.090
Calling me a sinner of the heavens
and god-killer...

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.610
I don't even know what you're talking about.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:28.540
I'm sure you don't...
You may not believe this,

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:32.210
but your fate has been tied to the
King of the Underworld since the age of myths.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:37.870
Your intertwined fate will surely
change this Holy War's direction.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.030
From the age of myth,

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:43.920
the Pegasus Saint has always
stood by Athena, in countless Holy Wars.

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.600
That's right.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:50.180
The Pegasus Saint is the only human
to hurt the god of the Underworld.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:54.870
But as far as I have seen,
you, the Pegasus Saint's current incarnation,

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:58.600
are clumsy, violent, and emotional.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:02.720
If the outcome of the Holy War
lies with someone like you...

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:04.910
The world cannot be saved.

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:06.440
Whatever!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.950
I'm here to protect the Earth and Sasha!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.720
I told you.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:14.950
Your weak fists have no effect on me.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.630
<i>These visions flowing into my mind...</i>

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:21.750
<i>Are these...</i>

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.580
<i>The Buddha?</i>

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:30.970
No! Who are you?

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:35.650
Now, I am but a seeker,
searching for the truth.

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:38.480
You cannot defeat the King of the Underworld,
without first defeating me.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:42.600
Now show me your reason.

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:46.230
Without a reason, this war cannot be redeemed.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:48.170
<i>Om.</i>

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.450
Demon Pacifier.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:15:00.330
Stand! If this is the limit of your power,

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.740
then it is also the limit of your reason.

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:06.000
Who are you? Why do you fight?

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.670
Answer me.

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:10.840
It... It's obvious!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.010
If you're a Saint of Athena...

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.360
You fight for peace on Earth!

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:17.610
Fool!

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:23.290
Anyone can spout a slogan.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:26.110
That isn't enough to convince me.

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:30.760
You lack substance. You have no reason.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.560
It's as the King of the Underworld says.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:37.380
Rather than a life of pain and
suffering in this world,

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:43.780
it is better to be released and held
in death's calm, serene arms.

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:49.070
Pegasus Saint, it is futile for you
to live again in this world.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:52.530
I suggest you burn in hell's fires and turn to ash.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:55.360
<i>Six Paths of Transmigration!</i>

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.380
Hell...

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:04.690
Where those who sin in the world
go to pay their debts.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.700
The Hungry Ghost World...

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:11.190
Where those who owe a debt of greed fall.

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:12.990
Beast World...

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:15.680
Where those who were led by their base desires

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:18.080
are reincarnated as beasts to pay their debts.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.690
The Carnage World...

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:25.210
Those who fall here must fight their
enemies constantly, without rest.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:32.280
Next is the world where the most foolish fall.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.190
The Human World.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:38.720
<i>My...</i>

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:40.720
<i>hometown!</i>

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:44.260
A world where humans are bound by suffering,

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:47.480
an unstable world where good and evil fluctuate.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:54.500
<i>The dirty town, tired people.</i>

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:55.410
<i>The sadness.</i>

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:59.160
<i>Hungry children, unhappy people...</i>

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:02.980
<i>Separation, people with hatred...</i>

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:09.460
<i>You're leaving.</i>

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.830
<i>Promise.</i>

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:14.370
<i>Alone... Sasha!</i>

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:16.470
Alone!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.360
Sasha!

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.350
The Deva World...

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:26.190
Where even the gods cannot escape,

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:29.550
the most dangerous place
from which to fall into hell.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.440
Pegasus Saint...

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:34.620
You've endured countless
incarnations as a Saint of Athena,

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:38.990
fought many gods, and hurt
a former King of the Underworld.

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.650
Perhaps because of this,

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:46.120
King Hades hid his body in the
Underworld paradise, Elysium.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.260
When invading the Earth,

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:53.500
he would take the body of the
boy with his age's purest soul

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.600
to reincarnate into.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:58.760
A boy like your friend, Alone.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:08.460
Not that you can do anything by
learning of your former sins now.

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:12.860
<i>It's my fault?</i>

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.200
<i>Is it my fault</i>

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.910
<i>that Alone became Hades?</i>

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.760
Past lives, fate...

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:27.410
I don't understand all this stuff!

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:33.840
This and this alone is my reason...

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:38.340
Up till now, I've been fighting for Alone and Sasha.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:42.850
The promise I made when I was young
dictates the path I follow.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:45.810
It doesn't matter what era we're in!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:50.270
No matter how many times
I'm reincarnated, I'll always fight...

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:53.730
...for the people important to me!

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:58.490
<i>Kaan!</i>

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.980
What a waste of effort. Foolish and simple...

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.620
But very human.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.550
I see. I understand your reason.

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:20.010
But your fists will not even scratch me,
as I sit and meditate.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:23.930
However, I'm interested in your soul's strength.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:27.310
<i>Asmita...</i>

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:32.150
<i>...has come out of his meditation pose!</i>

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:36.210
Be honored that I have come down to Earth,

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.400
Pegasus Saint.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.370
I thought I'd show my respect to you,

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:43.660
who has survived the Demon Pacifier
and the Six Paths of Transmigration.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:46.490
<i>He's threatening me.</i>

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:52.360
I, Virgo Asmita, will vanquish you
with my supreme spirituality.

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:02.510
<i>Treasures of the Heavens!</i>

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:09.590
<i>My body! It's numb...</i>

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.220
<i>I can't feel! I'm disappearing...</i>

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.520
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:17.700
Treasures of the Heavens is the universe's truth.

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:22.230
Anyone hit with it cannot run or fight,

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:24.140
and they lose all five senses.

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:26.570
I already took your sense of feeling.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:33.650
Since you're a spirit, losing your five senses means

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:35.330
your extinction.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.840
Smell... Taste... Gone!

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:45.800
How is your reason now, Pegasus Saint?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:49.090
Aren't you going to fight? To live?

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:50.720
For your friends?

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.560
Hearing... Gone!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.750
<i>My friends...</i>

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.360
Sight... Gone!

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:04.970
<i>I can't feel anything.</i>

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:09.870
<i>Are all five senses gone, in a place like this?</i>

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:16.110
All that's left is the sixth sense, thought and mind.

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:19.840
But when I lower my hand, even this will vanish.

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:26.380
Your reason, to fight for your friends
and your promise, will end.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:31.390
Which means this...

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.140
<i>Sasha!</i>

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.890
<i>Asmita, what are...</i>

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:41.720
This little girl's reason to protect
the Earth will also end.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:45.400
The Earth will fall into the
King of the Underworld's hands.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:47.640
<i>Stop! Stop it!</i>

00:21:57.560 --> 00:21:59.210
Asmita...

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:04.340
Asmita!

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:07.880
<i>Kaan!</i>

00:22:10.860 --> 00:22:13.560
I can't just let

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:18.770
that happen!

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:07.460
Asmita, how do you see Tenma?

00:24:08.030 --> 00:24:12.400
Emotional, passionate, and so very human?

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:18.200
I'm sure a man like you understands
what lies in his heart.

00:24:18.760 --> 00:24:22.690
And the hopes that live within him.

00:24:23.410 --> 00:24:26.650
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:26.650 --> 00:24:27.980
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:28.470 --> 00:24:30.000
A Favorable Wind.
